# Universal Print Resources

[](#universal-print-resources)

## Purpose of this repo

[](#purpose-of-this-repo)

This repo is intended for the Universal Print team to share resources that may be useful to developers and administrators, including:

-   **Sample scripts** that demonstrate how to automate common Universal Print tasks (see the [`Scripts`](/microsoft/universal-print-resources/blob/main/Scripts) folder).
-   **Deployment templates** for setting up related Azure infrastructure (see the [`Templates`](/microsoft/universal-print-resources/blob/main/Templates) folder).
-   **Troubleshooting scripts** that help diagnose issues, such as [`PrintTrace.cmd`](/microsoft/universal-print-resources/blob/main/PrintTrace.cmd) for collecting print traces.

The Universal Print team does not make any commitments to the frequency of updating these resources or to responding to issues reported about them.

## Contents

[](#contents)

Resource

Description

[BadgeReleaseDemo](/microsoft/universal-print-resources/blob/main/BadgeReleaseDemo)

Interactive .NET console app demonstrating the Universal Print badge release lifecycle (printer registration, secure-release sharing, badge management, and IPP job fetch).

[Scripts](/microsoft/universal-print-resources/blob/main/Scripts)

PowerShell scripts and the Universal Print connector sample.

[PrintTrace.cmd](/microsoft/universal-print-resources/blob/main/PrintTrace.cmd)

Batch script for collecting Universal Print client diagnostic traces.

