# PrintLoop Frontend Complete Redesign Plan

## Executive Summary

**Goal**: Complete redesign of 40+ page PrintLoop frontend to a modern SaaS aesthetic (Linear/Stripe/Vercel style), removing Univer editor, 3D Paper, and Three.js dependencies entirely.

**Scope**: Full redesign of 40+ pages across marketing, customer, SaaS, admin, and kiosk domains.

**Timeline**: No pressure - "as long as it takes"

**Team**: Solo implementation but "do like a team would" - comprehensive, well-structured approach

