## Redesign Strategy

### Design Direction: Modern SaaS Aesthetic (Linear/Stripe/Vercel)

| Aspect | Current (Editorial-Brutalist) | Target (Modern SaaS) |
|--------|------------------------------|---------------------|
| **Color** | Ink/paper/persimmon/ochre/sage (high contrast, print-inspired) | Neutral grays + single brand accent (indigo/violet), semantic colors (success/warning/error) |
| **Typography** | Fraunces (serif display) + Inter + JetBrains Mono | Geist/Instrument Sans (display) + Geist/Instrument Sans (body) + JetBrains Mono |
| **Spacing** | 4px base, generous | 4px base, tighter density |
| **Borders** | 2px ink, hard offsets | 1px subtle, 8-12px radius |
| **Shadows** | Hard 5px offset (brutalist) | Soft, layered elevation (0/1/2/3/4) |
| **Motion** | ScrollFx reveals, 3D, typewriter, 3D paper | Subtle micro-interactions, Framer Motion, reduced motion respect |
| **Density** | Editorial, spacious | Dense, efficient, data-dense |
| **Components** | Custom pl-* classes | shadcn/ui + Radix primitives + custom design tokens |

